    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba916a62de74395f6c5015de",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……呵呵，原来如此。\n命运对我低语，将我引导至此的真正理由，\n并非伏特加而是你吗──",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6dba5c4fffade504af4a8ea59cfe71dbc31baecb6655d33e61084942e3fc593",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
