      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "吉兆听到这则消息时的表情──\n我从那眼神深处，\n感受到她似乎下了一个新的决心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cf16903fdafb55e2b22df6b77e5e8ac17c8c5cb8f980f135e7e90b127fb2a50",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
